Common Type CTEProgram
    documentation 'The career cluster or pathway representing the career path of the 
    'Vocational/Career Tech concentrator.
    enumeration CareerPathway
        documentation 'A sequence of courses within an area of interest that is a student's educational 
        'road map to a chosen career.
        is part of identity
    string CIPCode
        documentation 'Number and description of the CIP Code associated with the student's CTEProgram..
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 120
    bool PrimaryCTEProgramIndicator
        documentation 'A boolean indicator of whether this CTEProgram, is the student's primary CTEProgram.
        is optional
    bool CTEProgramCompletionIndicator
        documentation 'A boolean indicator of whether the Student has completed the CTEProgram.
        is optional

